  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/motor_control_protocol.c **** *            of the motor control protocol component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/motor_control_protocol.c **** *
